{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "46e0bbabf0c33260b7386f0a4ffba1fe77b08ba39105a434bd37974aa6ebb580",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0001",
      "text": "Vault can be removed despite having pending redeems",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 51,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0002",
      "text": "## Finding description and impact",
      "start": 53,
      "end": 86,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0003",
      "text": "There exists a sequence of actions by the user where a pending redeem request can be ignored by the Owner when setting vault inactive and unregistering the vault.",
      "start": 88,
      "end": 250,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0004",
      "text": "This happens because of a missing pendingRedeemCheck and a flow of execution where, the `activeRedeemRequestersCount` can be made 0 despite a pending redeem request.",
      "start": 252,
      "end": 417,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0005",
      "text": "### ActiveRedeemRequesters is added with controller",
      "start": 420,
      "end": 471,
      "line": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0006",
      "text": "### Redeem shares fulfilled",
      "start": 474,
      "end": 501,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0007",
      "text": "### Redeem request again, activeRedeemRequesters has it already added and no duplicates",
      "start": 504,
      "end": 591,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0008",
      "text": "Now, pendingRedeemShares has ~ shares",
      "start": 594,
      "end": 631,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0009",
      "text": "### User claims now",
      "start": 633,
      "end": 652,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0010",
      "text": "As you can see, he can claim the complete shares that the first redeem request fulfilled. However controller is removed from `activeRedeemRequesters` despite there being another pending redeem request being active currently.",
      "start": 656,
      "end": 880,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0011",
      "text": "In the check for unregister.",
      "start": 882,
      "end": 910,
      "line": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0012",
      "text": "`activeRedeemRequestersCount` can be made zero via the above scenario and vault can be unregistered despite an active pending redeem request and the shares sent by user are stuck because of it.",
      "start": 913,
      "end": 1106,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0013",
      "text": "vault can be removed despite having pending redeems",
      "start": 1109,
      "end": 1160,
      "line": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0014",
      "text": "steps to reproduce:",
      "start": 1162,
      "end": 1181,
      "line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0015",
      "text": "1. user redeem requests",
      "start": 1183,
      "end": 1206,
      "line": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0016",
      "text": "2. request is fulfilled",
      "start": 1207,
      "end": 1230,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0017",
      "text": "3. user redeem requests again",
      "start": 1231,
      "end": 1260,
      "line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0018",
      "text": "4. user claims original redeem fulfil",
      "start": 1261,
      "end": 1298,
      "line": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0019",
      "text": "5. vault can be unregistered despite containing share",
      "start": 1299,
      "end": 1352,
      "line": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0020",
      "text": "more common with vault that doesn't have much liquidity yet and share was minted through different vault.",
      "start": 1354,
      "end": 1459,
      "line": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0021",
      "text": "since vault is inactive and removed now no one else can deposit to vault, the shares will be stuck with no asset to redeem it with in",
      "start": 1461,
      "end": 1594,
      "line": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "e_46e0bbabf0c3_0022",
      "text": "removed vault.",
      "start": 1596,
      "end": 1610,
      "line": 45
    }
  ]
}
